  "verificationScope": "# Original affine Koszul restriction on the actual geometric cut\n\nLet R,S be commutative rings, phi:R->S the original homomorphism, and\nN any original R-module. Construct actual affine pushforward/global-section\nand geometric pullback/extension-of-scalars natural isomorphisms from\nexisting native mathlib adjunctions. Under the SAME native tensor comparison,\nthe ACTUAL geometric unit sends original n to 1 tensor n.\nLet J be an original ideal and i:Spec(R/J)->Spec R the original quotient cut.\nThen construct tilde(N/JN) ~= i_*i^*tilde N and PROVE that the original quotient\nmorphism tilde(N)->tilde(N/JN), followed by this same iso, equals the ACTUAL\ngeometric pullback/pushforward UNIT.\nLet r=n+1>=1,H=(H_1,...,H_r),I=(H),K_j=exterior^j R^r,v_r the ORIGINAL ordered\ntop generator,and d the ORIGINAL Koszul differential. Then the SAME actual\ninternal-Hom sequence into tilde N ends in ACTUAL i_*i^*tilde N and is exact/epi.\nUnder the SAME original Hom-term iso, the last MORPHISM is precisely tilde of\nL->L(v_r), followed by the ACTUAL original geometric restriction unit.\nNo FP/flat/free/invertibility/CM of N, H regularity, Noetherianity, field or desired\ncomparison/exactness/unit/restriction compatibility certificate is an input.\nSource exterior FP is proved in the reused original module.\n\nLet R,S be commutative rings,phi:R->S the original homomorphism,and N any original R-module. Construct the actual affine pushforward/global-section natural isomorphism and actual geometric pullback/extension-of-scalars natural isomorphism from the existing native adjunctions. For an original algebra R->S the actual geometric unit sends n to 1 tensor n under the SAME constructed geometric-pullback/native-tensor isomorphism. This original UNIT/value square is now proved,using pinned Adjunction.unit_leftAdjointUniq_hom_app and original tensor values,not a compatibility certificate. For an original ideal J and SAME quotient cut i:Spec(R/J)->SpecR,construct tilde(N/JN) ~= i_*i^*tilde N and PROVE the original quotient morphism tilde(N)->tilde(N/JN) followed by this SAME iso equals the ACTUAL geometric pullback/pushforward UNIT. Let r=n+1>=1,H be the original ordered r equations,I=(H),K_j their original exterior Koszul terms,and v_r the original ordered top generator. The SAME original actual internal-Hom top sequence into tilde N with endpoint i_*i^*tilde N is constructed and proved exact/epi. Under the SAME actual Hom-term isomorphism its last MORPHISM is precisely tilde of L->L(v_r),followed by the ACTUAL original geometric restriction unit. No FP/flat/free/invertibility/CM of N,H regularity,Noetherianity,field or desired pullback/quotient/exactness/naturality/unit/restriction compatibility certificate is an input. Source exterior FP is proved in the reused original module. This completes the original AFFINE geometric cut restriction diagram,not GLOBAL line-bundle gluing,global epsilon/connecting or derived SHEAF/proper duality. Normalized theta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180. All guards and old resource holds remain intact.\n\nOPEN: Actual derived MODULE Ext with arbitrary original coefficient N and a:R->N; preserve a(1) mod IN using the actual original all-prime regular-or-unit Koszul projective resolution.\nGlue original line-bundle frames and twists; identify original GLOBAL epsilon and connecting class.\nActual Cech-to-derived SHEAF/proper-duality and original nonzero fixed-m section production.\nNormalized dualizing theta UNVERIFIED; original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,checkpoint180.\nOriginal4.1/4.2/main OPEN; normalized theta UNVERIFIED; checkpoint180.\nThis is an AFFINE geometric restriction computation; GLOBAL original line-bundle\nframes/twists, GLOBAL epsilon/connecting, derived SHEAF/proper duality and the\noriginal nonzero fixed-m section production remain open. No whole-project\ncheckpoint or new remote Lean CI claim. Immutable previous components keep\n their own historical scope flags unchanged.\n\n11 root modules,615 physical source lines,18 exact declarations\n(11 proofs,7 definitions);62 closed\nmodules,51 byte-identical older frozen dependencies.\nAll18 exact types manually read; only standard Lean axioms propext,\nClassical.choice and Quot.sound. Single compiler,8GiB,2threads,CPU25%,20min;\nall old holds retained. Lean4.35.0-rc3; mathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
